{'symbol': 'TMO', 'date': '2022-12-14 16:10:00', 'title': "FDA GRANTS EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION FOR THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC'S MONKEYPOX TEST", 'text': 'CARLSBAD, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC, THE WORLD LEADER IN SERVING SCIENCE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS GRANTED EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION (EUA) FOR ITS APPLIED BIOSYSTEMS TAQPATH MONKEYPOX/ORTHOPOX VIRUS DNA KIT, A POLYMERASE CHAIN REACTION (PCR) TEST DESIGNED TO DETECT NON-VARIOLA ORTHOPOXVIRUSES, INCLUDING MONKEYPOX VIRUS, IN APPROXIMATELY THREE-AND-A-HALF HOURS.'}